        <a href="/blogs/new-zealand-income-tax-for-expats-foreigners-non-residents/" class="text-link hover:underline font-medium">NZ Expat & Foreigner Tax Guide</a>
        <a href="/blogs/how-to-file-new-zealand-income-tax-return-ird-guide/" class="text-link hover:underline font-medium">How to File NZ Tax Return</a>
